  "notes": "First model of the Gemini 2.0 family. Released as an experimental model on 2024-12-11 and generally available as gemini-2.0-flash-001 on 2025-02-05; the Gemini API deprecations page and the Agent Platform page give February 5, 2025 as the release date of the GA model ids. The experimental id gemini-2.0-flash-exp was scheduled for shutdown on 2025-12-09 (announced 2025-11-04 in the release notes). Deprecation of the GA ids was announced on 2026-02-18 and they were shut down on 2026-06-01. The model card states a knowledge cutoff of June 2024."
